The skies the field's lighting uses as a sky-light cubemap (lane V2). Fetched by
tools/assets/field/fetch_field_assets.py at Poly Haven's 1k resolution, each checked against the md5
Poly Haven's API publishes, and kept byte for byte.

Both are from Poly Haven (polyhaven.com), released under CC0 1.0 Universal
(creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/): dedicated to the public domain, free to use, change
and redistribute for any purpose, with no attribution required. They are credited here anyway.

